  m_text: "What this shader reads: the direction of each light, like Lit, but it turns the result into a few flat steps of brightness instead of a smooth gradient: Steps sets how many. A second pass draws the mesh again, a little larger and inside out, in one colour: the outline.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>File: Packages \u203A Toolbox \u203A Shaders \u203A Surfaces \u203A Simple-Toon \u203A Shaders \u203A STOutline.shader (menu Mavrodiev > Surfaces > Simple-Toon-Outline)</color></size>"
