  m_text: "What this shader reads: time, to slide two ripple normal maps over each other; the image behind it (the Opaque Texture); and the depth behind it (the Depth Texture), to find how much water lies above the floor. The same shader makes a deep pool and a flooded floor: only the material's values differ.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>File: Packages \u203A Toolbox \u203A Shaders \u203A Surfaces \u203A Water.shader</color></size>"
