  m_text: "What this shader reads: the lights on the far side of the cloth, which it adds as light coming through (the figure's shadow comes through too); and time, in the vertex stage, which moves every vertex so the cloth waves. The curtain is a plane with 3,871 vertices: only vertices that exist can move.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>File: Packages \u203A Toolbox \u203A Shaders \u203A Surfaces \u203A Curtain.shader</color></size>"
